      "content": "I spent the morning looking at my last score. It’s... it's done. There's nothing left to write. I feel like I've finally reached the summit, and looking out from here, the view is perfect, but there's nowhere left to go but down. Everything after this just feels like a slow, messy decline into something I don't recognize.",
